1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Your rear defroster comes on...
but the glass never fully clears.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Most of it clears.
One thin band stays fogged, every time.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,000
One clue: those are heating grid lines
baked onto the glass.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
A scraper, cargo, even corrosion
can snap just one line.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Don't guess the whole thing is dead.
A multimeter can find the exact break.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Worth checking before you replace
more than you need to.
Stop by and we'll take a look.
